<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2Watesaloniki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya ivili lya Paulo kwa Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Wat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya ivili lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Watesaloniki</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba lya ivili kwa Watesaloniki iyandikilwi na mndumindumi Paulo ku Sula gha 1:1. Paulo ayandikili lihamba hai lipindi lihupi badili gha lihamba lya mtumbulo kwa Watesaloniki, handa kunu lipindi lya machuva 51 badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito. Paulo ayandikili lihamba hai kwa lipinga lya wandu Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito lya haku ku Tesaloniki akiva ku Kolinto, Lipinga alitumbulisili ku lihanja ghaki lya ivili gha kutangasa Habali zya Yesu Kilisito, hai inguwoneka ku Matendu sula gha 17:1-10. Kihitabu kya Matendu kingulongela yiwa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito lya Tesaloniki liwelili na Wayahudi mayaghani na Wagiliki watangala.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila kilisito lya Watesaloniki wawelili wakiliwachila lila lipindi lya mwihu na kuhika kwa lihanja lya ivili kwa Kilisito, kwaikiva Paulo ayandikili nesu kulihamba zyaki zyogha ivili kwa Watesalonike. Mandina gha lihamba lya ivili kwa Watesaloniki ingulongela machuwa gha mwihu. Paulo kangi akanisili kuleka upweli. Kila mundu angupalwa kughola lihengu ili apati mulyo ku Sula gha 3:6-10.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumbula kuyandika lihamba kwa kujimanyisa mweni na wayaki ku Sula gha 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Angumshukwile Sapanga kwa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito lya ku Tesaloniki na kuwayupila ku Sula gha 1:3-12.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angulongela mighalu gha lipindi lya mwihu Ku Sula gha ivili.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angulongela mighalu gha upweli na vila tungupalwa kughola lihengu ku Sula gha 3:1-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyomola kwa kujambusa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito ku Sula gha 3:16-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Nenga Paulo na Silivano na Timoseo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">tunguwayandikila mwenga lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito mvile haku ku Tesalonike, mvile ni wandu ghaki Sapanga Tati wa twenga na Bambu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Tunguwatakila manemu na kulikala kwa kukotoho kutovana kuhuma kwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga na kwa Bambu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamulo paatehika Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Walongu, tungupalwa kumshukwile Sapanga machuwa hyogha kwaikiva gha mwenga. Ingutupala twenga kughola nagha kwaikiva ukwinila wa mwenga ungukula na upalo wa kila mmonga paghati mwa mwenga unguyongeseka nesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ndiwa kwaikiva twenga tunguidumbila mwenga kumapinga gha wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito kwaikiva tunguidumbila kwa vila mnguyendelela kukwinila na kufumilila paghati gha uhakata wogha pamonga na mahakilo yala munguyapokela. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Hagha hyogha ni uhighilisu yiwa ulamulo wa Sapanga ni chakaka na kwaikiva gha nagha mwenga mtevalangilwa yiwa mngupalwa kupokela unkosi wa Sapanga, hula mwenga mnguhakilwa kwaikiva gha weni. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Sapanga ateghola mghalu upalwa kugholwa, atewahuyisila mahakilo wala wandu wanguwahakila mwenga, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />na atewapegha luheku mwenga muhakilwa pamonga na twenga. Ateghola mghalu hau lipindi Bambu paahuya kuhuma kundumba pamonga na watumikila ghaki wa kundumba wa Sapanga weni makakala, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />na mihali gha lyoto, kuwahakila wala wandu wogha wammanya ng'ogha Sapanga na wala wamkwinila ng'ogha Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Kunyokolwa kwa weni kutevile ni kuyalamiswa machuwa yayendelela na kubaghulwa weka kutali na Bambu na ukwilikihi ghaki mkulu, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />lichuwa lila paatehika kupokela ukwilikihi kula kwa wambulete nesu ghaki na utundamilu kuhuma kwa wogha wala wakwinila. Na mwenga hilahila mtewela paghati mwa weni, kwaikiva muukwinila hula ujumbi tuwalongelili.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ndiwa kwaikiva tunguwayupila mwenga machuwa hyogha kwa Sapanga, ili Sapanga wa twenga awavalangile yiwa mpalwa kukemwa waghola lihengu lyaki, na kwa uweso ghaki apati kuwawesesa kutimilila kwa makakala ghaki yala hyogha maheli mngupala na mtimilisi mahengu gha mwenga hyogha gha ukwinila. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Tunguyupa nagha lukani lihina lya Bambu wa twenga Yesu lipati kutundamilwa mghati mwa mwenga, na mwenga mtepokela ukwilikihi kuhuma kwa mweni kwa manemu gha Sapanga wa twenga na gha Bambu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Yula Mhyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Paahuya Yesu Bambu wa twenga, tutelikungula pamonga kuwela na mweni, hinu ninguwaluwa nesu nesu walongu wa nenga, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />mkotoho kuyumbila kwa uyuyughu na vilavila mkotoho kutaywa holu na mpumulo yoyosi hata kwa lilando au lihamba yoyosi iwachilwa yiwa ihuma kwa twenga ingulongela yiwa lichuwa lya Bambu lihika kala. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Mkotoho kulongelwa uhwangi na mundu yoyosi kwa njila yoyosi hila. Kwaikiva lichuwa lila litehika ng'ogha mbaka kuhumili huti uhakata na yula mhyuka awoneki huti, hayu mwihu ghaki ni kuyalamiswa tukutuku. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Mweni atengingama na kujiyinula kunani gha kila kindu kila wangukikema yiwa ni mulungu au kingutundamilwa, ili kujivika kunani gha kulighuta lya Sapanga, akilitangasila mweni yiwa ni Sapanga.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ghuli, mkumbwike ng'ogha yiwa niwalongelili hagha hyogha lipindi niwelili pamonga na mwenga? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ila kuvile na kindu kingumlemesa hinaa, na mwenga mngukimanya kindu haki. Hinu, hayu muhakata atewoneka kwa lipindi lyaki. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Makakala zihighala zya yula mhakata zingughola lihengu mbaka hinaa, ila atewoneka ng'ogha mbaka yula mweni kumlemesa paahusiwi, <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />hinaa ndiwa yula mhyuka atehumila. Mundu hayu Bambu Yesu paahika atemkoma kwa kupumula kumlomu ghaki na kumyalamisa tukutuku kwa ukwilikihi wa kuhika kwa mweni. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Hayu Mhyuka atehika na makakala gha Lihyukana na kughola vilangihi na makangaso gha weka weka na maloloso gha uhwangi, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />na kutumila uhwangi wa kila njila kwa wala wanguyaghamila kwaikiva walemili kupala uchakaka ili wapati kulokolwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ndiwa kwaikiva Sapanga kawavika pahi gha makakala gha kubyodosa, ili wakwinili uhwangi, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />na walamulwi wogha wala wakwinila ng'ogha chakaka, ila wakaihekelelela sambi.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhaghulwa ili mpati kulokolwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Tungupalwa kumshukwile Sapanga machuwa yayendelela kwaikiva gha mwenga walongu, mwenga mngupalwa na Bambu, kwaikiva Sapanga awahaghulili mwenga kuhuma mtumbulo ili mlokolwi kupitila kughululwa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kwa kukwinila chakaka. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Sapanga katumila kutangasa Habali Maha kwa twenga handa njila ghaki kuwakema mwenga ili mpati kupokela mahala kuukwilikihi wa Bambu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Hinu, walongu wa twenga, mgholoki maha na kuyakovekela yala mavulo tuwavulili kwa kupitila kuwatangasila na kuwayandikila lihamba.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Tungumluwa Bambu wa twenga Yesu kilisito na Tati wa twenga Sapanga yula atupalili na kwa manemu ghaki akatutaya moyu machuwa yayendelela na litumaini lyeni makakala, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />awapeghi moyu na kuwagholosa maha ili muwesi machuwa yayendelela kughola na kulongela ghala gha maha.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mtuyupili kwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Kumwihu walongu, mtuyupili ili lilando lya Bambu lilandali kwa kuloposela na kupokelwa kwa kutundamilwa handa vila ivile kwa mwenga. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Mtuyupili hilahila kwa Sapanga ili atulokoli na wandu wahakata na weni sambi, kwaikiva ng'ogha wandu wogha wanguukwinila ujumbi hau.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ila Bambu Yesu yula angughola kila alaghilili. Mweni atewapegha makakala na kuwagholokela maha kwa yula mhakata. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Na mweni Bambu katupatila ukwinila mkulunga kwa mwenga na twahela holu yiwa mngughola na mnguyendelela kughola yala tuwalaghilili.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Bambu alongoli mioyu gha mwenga kuupalo wa Sapanga na kuufumilifu hula tungupeghwa na Kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likalipilo kwa wala wapweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Walongu, tunguwalaghila kwa lihina lya Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito, mlekani na walongu wogha wala wavile wapweli na wala wogha wapala ng'ogha kukovekela malaghililo ghala tuwapeghili. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Mwenga mwaweni mngumanya yiwa mngupalwa kukovikela mlandano wa twenga. Twenga patuwelili na mwenga tuwelili ng'ogha wapweli, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />twenga tulyegha ng'ogha mulyo kwa mundu yoyose yaghi yaghi. Tugholili lihengu kwa makakala nesu na tughasika nesu pamuhi na uhiku ili tukotoho kuwela mhighu kwa mundu yoyose paghati gha mwenga. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Tugholili nagha ng'ogha kwaikiva tupalwa ng'ogha kupokela mtanga kuhuma kwa mwenga ila kwaikiva tungupala kuwapegha mlandano wa kukovekela. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Patuwelili pamonga na mwenga tuwalaghilili yiwa, “Mundu yoyose kapala ng'ogha kughola lihengu, na akotoho kulyegha.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Tungulonga milandu hayi kwaikiva tuyoghanila yiwa paghati gha mwenga ni wapweli na waghola ng'ogha chochose, ila wandu weni kubyodosa mighalu gha wandu ghangi. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Kwa lihina lya Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito tunguwalaghila na kuwakanisa wandu hagha wapongi na kughola lihengu ili wawesi kuipatila mulyo ghao weni baha.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ila mwenga walongu, mkotoho kutoka kughola mighalu maha. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ikiva mundu yoyose kakola ng'ogha hagha malaghililo gha twenga hagha gha mulihamba hai, mumloli nesu mundu hayu mkotoho kuwela na mweni pabehi ili aloli honi. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />mkotoho kumvalangila mundu hayu handa mhakata, ila mumkanisi handa mlongu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando gha kuyomokela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Hinu Bambu apala ng'ogha kutovana, awapeghi kulikala kwa kutovana ng'ogha machuwa hyogha kwa njila wekaweka, Bambu aweli na mwenga wogha.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Nenga Paulo, ninguyandika lijambuso hali kwa liwoku lya nenga baha. Haki ndiwa kilangihi kulihamba zyangu zyogha. Havi ndiwa ninguyandika.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Tunguwatakila mwenga wogha manemu gha Bambu wa twenga Yesu kilisito.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>